<div class="ledger-row"><span>Current voter recalculation</span><b>consideration [? if status_pres_feedback_consideration >= 0: +?][+ status_pres_feedback_consideration +] · turnout [? if status_pres_feedback_turnout >= 0: +?][+ status_pres_feedback_turnout +]</b></div>
<div class="ledger-subrow">[+ status_pres_feedback_months +] of [+ status_pres_feedback_duration +] monthly rebuilds remain. Leadership pressure [+ status_pres_feedback_leadership +]/100 · tactical flight [+ status_pres_feedback_tactical +] · base certainty [+ status_pres_feedback_certainty +]/100.</div></div>?]

